<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Scholastic upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Scholastic upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it raised its rating on Scholastic Corp to hold from sell.</p>
<p>-- analyst Rudolf Hokanson said &quot;stock price reflects the middle of a presumed trading range, and is not likely to move down or up much further without significant new news.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 32-1/2.</p>
</text>
